  "open_questions": [
   "Exact month/day of the 2008 completion is not sourced, only the year.",
   "The 2007 crane permit's own block/lot (block 8721, lot 001) differs from the lot the Assessor now uses for this address (lot 010); the address and 2008-04-24 permit-completion date (matching the Assessor's 2008 year) line up with this parcel, so this is treated as a lot renumbering, not a different building.",
   "The building's later Cisco/Meraki tenant history is not established here. A San Francisco Chronicle article (updated 2023-04-05) was cited earlier for a Meraki lease at this address, but the page could not be read when checked on 2026-10-12, so no tenant claim is made. The architect and general contractor come from the precast contractor's project page only.",
   "Cisco's move-in date at 500 Terry A. Francois Blvd is not given by any source found.",
   "Cisco's own office-locations page lists 500 Terry A. Francois Blvd as a San Francisco office address and gives no date; no source read dates when Cisco or its Meraki division began occupying the building."
